---
layout: base.njk
title: Articles
description: Writing on digital accessibility and AI for local government.
---
<header class="page-head">
  <h1>Articles</h1>
  <p class="lede">Writing on digital accessibility and AI for local government.</p>
</header>
{%- if collections.articles.length %}
<ul class="entries">
  {%- for a in collections.articles %}
  <li>
    <time datetime="{{ a.date | isoDate }}">{{ a.date | isoDate }}</time>
    <a href="{{ a.url }}">{{ a.data.title }}</a>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}
<p class="prose">The first article is in progress. In the meantime, the <a href="/log/">learning log</a> has shorter updates.</p>
{%- endif %}
